[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 4804.95, "timestamp": "01:20:04", "text": "呃，我該給自己升級一下力量嗎？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4808.07, "timestamp": "01:20:08", "text": "等等，你可以辦一張口袋卡。  是的，我的力量要提升了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4809.43, "timestamp": "01:20:09", "text": "。  順便說一句，我力氣太大，我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4811.35, "timestamp": "01:20:11", "text": "跌倒了。  我再買一個。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4820.55, "timestamp": "01:20:20", "text": "你可以想像"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4821.99, "timestamp": "01:20:21", "text": "他現在正在恢復理智。他得到了地雷。好的。是的，我們"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4825.189, "timestamp": "01:20:25", "text": "很好。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4827.51, "timestamp": "01:20:27", "text": "你剛才說什麼？什麼？礦井。你是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4832.47, "timestamp": "01:20:32", "text": "我的。好的。好的。呃，你們兩個，你們兩個都"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4835.35, "timestamp": "01:20:35", "text": "拿大號醫療包。哦，當然！好的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4837.27, "timestamp": "01:20:37", "text": "已經有人拿"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4838.95, "timestamp": "01:20:38", "text": "進去了。又一個。實際上，你們三個都"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4843.189, "timestamp": "01:20:43", "text": "需要它。我很安全。  好的。好的。好的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4844.87, "timestamp": "01:20:44", "text": "留著吧"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4847.99, "timestamp": "01:20:47", "text": "。升級。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4849.669, "timestamp": "01:20:49", "text": "其實，因為我打算犯傻。  等等，等等，等等。我需要幫你拿那個大的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4855.87, "timestamp": "01:20:55", "text": "不用擔心。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4859.35, "timestamp": "01:20:59", "text": "H 寶寶。"}]